---
---
<section class="pt-20 pb-16">
  <p class="font-mono text-sm text-muted mb-6 tracking-wide">
    An AI coding agent security scanner.
  </p>

  <h1 class="font-mono text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight mb-8" style="color: #e8e8e8;">
    Three problems your agent is<br/>creating right now.
  </h1>

  <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4" style="color: #aaaaaa; max-width: 600px;">
    SessionGuard is a local-only CLI that reads Claude Code session transcripts
    and surfaces what your agent actually did: secrets it touched, shell commands
    it ran, files it modified, hooks it bypassed.
  </p>

  <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-10" style="color: #aaaaaa; max-width: 600px;">
    Scans 6,883 events in ~350ms. Runs entirely on your machine.
    Nothing uploaded. MIT licence.
  </p>

  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mb-8">
    <div class="relative group">
      <button
        id="copy-install"
        class="font-mono text-sm px-5 py-3 rounded border border-line bg-surface text-accent hover:border-accent transition-colors duration-150 cursor-pointer flex items-center gap-3"
        aria-label="Copy install command"
      >
        <span>npm install -g @sessionguard/cli</span>
        <svg id="copy-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
          <rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
          <path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path>
        </svg>
      </button>
      <span id="copy-feedback" class="absolute -top-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 font-mono text-xs text-accent bg-surface border border-line px-2 py-1 rounded opacity-0 transition-opacity pointer-events-none whitespace-nowrap">
        Copied!
      </span>
    </div>

    <a
      href="#early-access"
      class="font-mono text-sm px-5 py-3 rounded bg-accent text-black font-semibold hover:bg-green-400 transition-colors duration-150"
    >
      Get early access →
    </a>
  </div>

  <p class="font-mono text-xs text-muted">
    v0.3.1 · 135 unit tests · Claude Code · Cursor + Windsurf on roadmap
  </p>
</section>

<script>
  const btn = document.getElementById('copy-install');
  const feedback = document.getElementById('copy-feedback');

  btn?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    await navigator.clipboard.writeText('npm install -g @sessionguard/cli');
    if (feedback) {
      feedback.style.opacity = '1';
      setTimeout(() => { feedback.style.opacity = '0'; }, 1800);
    }
  });
</script>
